==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spam meatshields and [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]], as well as any good [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark units]] you may have, like [[Ring Girl Cat]].

